flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2723352Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2731777Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2732277Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2732971Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2733255Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2733444Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2734592Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2734983Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2735264Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2735817Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2736075Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2736449Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2736981Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2737460Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2737819Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2737985Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2738268Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2738507Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2738703Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2739060Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2739196Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2739311Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2739483Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2739727Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2740170Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2742544Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2742728Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2742998Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2743240Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2743821Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2744406Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2744846Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2745121Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2745395Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2745763Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2746176Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2756342Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2756967Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2766728Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2767313Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2767679Z 
