flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2785102Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T10:40:00.2793781Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
